# NestJS 开发规范

## 装饰器使用规范

### 必需装饰器
```typescript
// 服务类
@Injectable()
export class AuthService { }

// 控制器类（必须指定 path 和 version）
@Controller({
  path: 'auth',
  version: '1',
})
export class AuthController { }

// 模块类
@Module({
  imports: [...],
  providers: [...],
  controllers: [...],
  exports: [...],
})
export class AuthModule { }

// 守卫（实现 CanActivate）
@Injectable()
export class AuthTokenGuard implements CanActivate { }

// 拦截器（实现 NestInterceptor）
@Injectable()
export class XssSanitizeInterceptor implements NestInterceptor { }

// 过滤器（实现 ExceptionFilter）
@Catch()
export class HttpExceptionFilter implements ExceptionFilter { }
```

### 控制器装饰器
```typescript
@Controller({
  path: 'auth',
  version: '1',
})
export class AuthController {
  @Post('/login')
  @HttpCode(200)
  async login(@Body() dto: AuthLoginDto) { }
  
  @Get('list')
  @UseGuards(AuthTokenGuard)
  list() { }
}
```

## 依赖注入规范

### 构造函数注入
```typescript
@Injectable()
export class AuthService {
  constructor(
    private readonly registryService: RegistryService,
    private readonly uxPasswordService: UxPasswordService,
  ) {}
}
```

### 模型注入
```typescript
@Injectable()
export class RegistryService {
  constructor(
    @InjectModel(Registry)
    public registryModel: typeof Registry,
    @InjectModel(Users)
    public usersModel: typeof Users,
  ) {}
}
```

### 循环依赖处理
```typescript
constructor(
  @Inject(forwardRef(() => UxCryptoRsaService))
  private readonly uxCryptoRsaService: UxCryptoRsaService,
) {}
```

## DTO 验证规范

### DTO 定义
```typescript
import { IsString, IsNotEmpty, IsEmail } from 'class-validator';
import { ApiProperty } from '@nestjs/swagger';

export class RegistryUserDto {
  @ApiProperty({
    description: 'User account',
    example: 'johndoe',
  })
  @IsString({ message: 'The account must be a string' })
  @IsNotEmpty({ message: 'Account cannot be empty' })
  account: string;

  @IsEmail({}, { message: 'Please enter a valid email address' })
  email: string;
}
```

### 验证规则
- 使用 `class-validator` 装饰器
- 为每个验证规则提供明确的错误消息
- 使用 `@ApiProperty()` 为 Swagger 添加文档
- DTO 放在对应模块的 `dto/` 目录

## API 响应格式规范

### 统一响应类
```typescript
// 成功响应
return new ApiResponse(HttpStatus.OK, 'Login successful', { token });

// 错误响应（通过异常抛出）
throw new HttpException('Account does not exist', HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST);
```

### 响应结构
```typescript
{
  code: number,      // HTTP 状态码
  message: string,   // 响应消息
  data?: T          // 响应数据（可选）
}
```

## 错误处理规范

### 异常抛出
```typescript
// 使用 HttpException
if (!result)
  throw new HttpException('Account does not exist', HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST);

// 使用自定义异常（验证失败）
throw new ValidateDtoException({
  status: HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST,
  message: 'Invalid parameters',
  errors: ['Account cannot be empty', 'Password cannot be empty'],
});
```

### 全局异常过滤
- 统一使用 `HttpExceptionFilter` 处理异常
- 错误消息使用英文
- 状态码使用 `HttpStatus` 枚举

## 数据库操作规范

### Sequelize 事务
```typescript
let transaction: Transaction;
try {
  transaction = await this.sequelize.transaction();
  await this.usersModel.create(data, { transaction });
  await this.registryModel.create(data, { transaction });
  await transaction.commit();
} catch (err) {
  if (transaction) await transaction.rollback();
  throw new HttpException(err.message, HttpStatus.INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR);
}
```

### 查询方法
```typescript
// 支持 attributes 和 where 参数
findOne(where?: WhereOptions<any>, attributes?: string[]): Promise<Registry | null> {
  return this.registryModel.findOne({
    where,
    attributes,
  });
}
```

### 模型定义
```typescript
@Table({ tableName: 'registry' })
export class Registry extends Model {
  @IsUUID(4)
  @PrimaryKey
  @Column
  declare id: string;

  @Column({ unique: true })
  declare account: string;
}
```

